	(text "Decoupling: C301 -> VDD pin 8, C302 -> VDDIO pin 5 (each within ~2 mm); C303 local bulk" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 132.08 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cc64935e-9aa6-44d1-929c-13b7183401ee"))
	(text "IMU - LSM6DS3TR-C (6-axis accel + gyro)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d9888363-14ac-4096-9407-76eb11c3c94a"))
	(text "I2C1 shared sensor bus (with the barometer). 4.7k pull-ups are on the MCU sheet; none here.\nI2C address 0x6A (SA0/SDO tied to GND). Tie SA0 to 3V3 instead for 0x6B.\nCS tied to 3V3 = I2C mode (CS low would select SPI).\nSDx/SCx (pins 2/3, aux sensor-hub master bus) unused -> GND. OCS_Aux/SDO_Aux (pins 10/11) left\nunconnected (hidden NC pins in the KiCad symbol). Pin 7 GND is stacked under pin 6.\nINT1 -> PC5, INT2 -> PC6 on the MCU (push-pull, active high by default; data-ready / FIFO / event).\nLAYOUT: C301/C302 within ~2 mm of pins 8/5. Mount the IMU near the board's centre of mass, away from\nmounting holes and board edges; no vias or copper pour under the LGA land; keep the part away from\nheat sources (regulator). Note the axis orientation on the silkscreen for firmware." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 140.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "231adac6-aacc-4b24-9059-f95cefd3267e"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
